        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/wet/scene_rat_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 8b5d93ba-88d7-4e28-b759-1cb155d91c08).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\rYour targets today are members of the Triad gang that run a money laundering business in a noodle shop in Chongqing.\rOur client who has recently had an unpleasant run-in with the Triad, wants revenge, and hired us to hit them where it hurts.\rWe have booked you an appartment with an excellent view of the restaurant. The access code is 0118.\rIt is expected that the situation in the area might get pretty hot, so you will have to use a manhole to escape.\rGood luck, 47.",
